 <p class="lede">GWO is the wind industry&#8217;s shared safety training standard. Without it you do not get onto a site; it is not a formality, it is the ticket in. My reason for writing this page: what the certificate-selling websites describe and what happens at the tower base are not the same thing. What follows comes from GWO&#8217;s own standard and from someone who took those courses and has used them in the field for thirteen years.</p>
 <p class="g-meta"><span>13 years in the field</span><span>BST &#183; BTT</span><span>Aliaga &amp; Bergama wind farms</span><span>Last updated: September 2026</span></p>
