+</section><section class="wrap"><div class="kisa" id="short"><p class="k">The short answer</p>
 <p><b>GWO</b> (Global Wind Organisation) was set up jointly by turbine manufacturers and
 wind farm owners, and it writes the safety training standard. The core package,
 <b>BST</b> (Basic Safety Training), has four modules and takes <b>four days</b>:</p>
